Rock TV
TV at "on" is "TV:on"
TV at "mute" is "TV:muted"

Rock Radio
Radio at "on" is "Radio:on"
Radio at "mute" is "Radio:muted"

Rock Basic
Basic at "action" is "on"

Rock Muting
Muting at "action" is "mute"

Put Basic at "action" into Basic Action
Put Muting at "action" into Mute Action
Put TV at Basic Action into Basic TV
Put Radio at Basic Action into Basic Radio
Put TV at Mute Action into Mute TV
Put Radio at Mute Action into Mute Radio

Print "basic-tv=" plus Basic TV
Print "basic-radio=" plus Basic Radio
Print "mute-tv=" plus Mute TV
Print "mute-radio=" plus Mute Radio
